%% Controls restrict authority; none grants mode/exit permission.
flowchart TD
  Intent[Entry / increase or reducing exit intent] --> Full{Full Kill active?}
  Full -->|Yes| Block[No new submission / prominent blocked risk]
  Full -->|No| Entry{Entry Halt active and increasing risk?}
  Entry -->|Yes| Block
  Entry -->|No| Health{Required action-specific health valid?}
  Health -->|No or unknown| Block
  Health -->|Yes| Permission[Mode / exit permission / final risk]
  Permission --> Qualification[Entry requires current qualified active scope]
  Qualification --> Admission[Serialized recheck / dispatch admission]
  Admission --> Paper[Paper adapter]
  Kill[Activate Full Kill] --> Cancel[Best-effort cancel working orders]
  Kill --> Continue[Continue receipts / Ledger / reconciliation / diagnostics]
  Paper --> Continue
  Kill --> Rearm[Explicit human re-arm / other gates remain]
